    "summary": "Norn Assimilator errata rewriting **[[HARPOONED]](vsdata:weapon-ability/harpooned)**. When you **declare a charge** with this unit, you may use it if an enemy **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit no more than 12\" away took a hit from this weapon this turn. If you do:\n\n- Until the phase ends, this unit adds 2 to its **charge rolls**.\n- Its **charge move** must finish **engaged** with that enemy unit.",
